[[Aeson]] is a student at [[Shing Jea Monastery]] who's also a member of the [[Luxon]] [[Crab Clan]]. He is available as a Ritualist [[henchman]] in some parts of [[Cantha]].

He is labeled as a [[Spirit Henchman]].

